  "body": "There is No plan B !!\r\n\r\nIf space, versatility and solid construction are high on your wish list, this fabulous 1970s home deserves your attention.\r\n\r\nSpread over two levels, this substantial family home offers five generous bedrooms, multiple living options and plenty of room for everyone to enjoy their own space. The floor plan lends itself to a home and granny set up.\r\n\r\nDownstairs is ideal for parents, teenagers, extended family or guests, with a spacious living area, kitchen and dining, plus two of the five bedrooms and a bathroom. The separate laundry and good-sized storage shed add practicality, while this level offers a wonderful degree of independence from the rest of the home. A heat pump downstairs provides year round comfort\r\n\r\nUpstairs has a generous lounge opening to decking and enjoying a pleasant outlook. Three further bedrooms, the family bathroom and a separate craft room/study provide plenty of options for family life, working from home or hobbies.A heat pump provides year round comfort\r\n\r\nBuilt with longevity in mind, the home features a solid block base and brick construction to the upper level — a combination that offers reassuring durability and low-maintenance living.\r\n\r\nOutside, life is equally easy. There’s plenty of off-street parking, a fully fenced garden for children and pets, and an easy-care exterior that gives you more time to enjoy the things that matter.\r\n\r\nThe location is another big plus. Parks are close by, local schools are within easy walking distance, and the property is zoned for Sherwood Primary and Northcross Intermediate. The local bus route is an easy stroll away, while Albany Mall, Browns Bay and the wider North Shore are all within easy driving distance.\r\n\r\nThis is a home with genuine substance, excellent flexibility and the space to accommodate a growing or extended family.\r\n\r\nSolid, spacious and seriously practical — come and see what this one can offer your family. Call me today to arrange a viewing",
